     1,
     "Hi \r\n\r\nKatrin,<div>I have the exact same issue -  gl.filter.hwe() doesnt remove any loci even though there are clearlery loci significantly out of HWE (according to gl.report.hwe). Did you have any luck resolving this or did you just do a work around?</div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Stephanie</div>"
