    [
     3,
     "<div><br></div><div><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Tuesday, October 8, 2019 at 11:09:13 AM UTC+10 <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">katrinho...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello, <div><br></div><div>is it possible that the gl.filter.hwe function does not work (anymore)?</div><div>It does not filter out any loci, however, the report shows that there are loci with significant departure from HWE. </div><div><br></div><div>Cheers, </div><div>Katrin</div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Thursday, 7 March 2019 15:55:21 UTC+10, Bernd. Gruber  wrote:</div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Hi Kasha,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Not sure on your script. Some of the functions use a “monte-carlo” test to find significance and maybe the one you found are close\r\n to the boundary due to not enough  bootstrap runs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Just a guess,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Cheers, Bernd</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">==============================================================================</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Dr Bernd Gruber\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                            )/_         \r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                                         _.--..---&quot;-,--c_    \r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Associate Professor      \r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                          \\|..&#39;           ._O__)_  \r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Tel: (02)\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">6206 3804                     \r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">   ,=.    _.+   _ \\..--( /          \r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier