     "<div>Hi Stephanie,</div><div><br></div><div>This issue has been solved in the beta version of dartR, which can be installed by typing in the R console:</div><div><br></div><div>library(dartR)<br># installing the beta version of dartR<br>gl.install.vanilla.dartR(flavour = &quot;beta&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Luis <br></div>"
